  m_Text: '<b>House 2: Residential House (0/10)</b>

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    1. Press Front Doorbell button

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 2. [SCRIPT]
    Swing House Front Door open

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 3. [SCRIPT] Slide
    Front Window open

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 4. [UI] Press Power on Boombox
    UI

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 5. [UI] Press Next Track on Boombox UI

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    6. [GRAB] Place Frying Pan onto Stove

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 7. Turn
    Stove Temperature Knob

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 8. [GRAB] Place raw
    Bacon into Pan (Sizzle)

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 9. [GRAB] Place Pan
    with cooked Bacon onto Table

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 10. Press Toilet
    Flush Handle in bathroom

'
